title: "Licence Files That Are Never Read"
message: "Cite this research note as below."
type: article
authors:
  - family-names: AlEnezi
    given-names: Ali
    alias: SiteQ8
    country: KW
date-released: 2026-09-04
url: "https://github.com/SiteQ8/Markaz/tree/main/publications/0001-licence-files-never-read"
abstract: >-
  A licence file can be present and readable to a person while every automated
  consumer treats it as absent. This note documents six causes, reports an audit
  of 109 repositories in which 21 carried an unreadable licence, and publishes a
  detector that reproduces the result against any GitHub account.
keywords:
  - open source
  - licensing
  - software supply chain
  - compliance
